+## Subtopics
+
+### JP3D (JPEG2000 Part-10)
+A standard specifically for 3D wavelet compression. It is mentioned as potentially providing better performance than the multi-component approach but was in the Working Draft stage at the time of the cited literature [S2].
+
+### Direction-Adaptive DWT (DA-DWT)
+An approach where the DWT direction is adapted to the data structure. It was evaluated for volumetric medical images but the sources indicate the standard 3D-DWT was chosen for its lack of KLT drawbacks [S3].
+
+### Block-based Intra-band Prediction
+An alternative approach to improve lossless JP3D bitrates by predicting within subbands [S3].
